WEBVTT

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.519
And of course, there was always
that question for him,

00:02:02.519 --> 00:02:04.521
"What do the neighbors think?"

00:02:05.288 --> 00:02:07.391
So rather than deal with me,

00:02:07.424 --> 00:02:09.493
he buried himself in hobbies

00:02:09.526 --> 00:02:11.862
and tried to ignore
the flamboyance of his son.

00:02:12.796 --> 00:02:13.964
As you can imagine,

00:02:13.997 --> 00:02:16.366
this left my mother
pretty on her own for a while,

00:02:16.366 --> 00:02:18.268
when my brother and I were little.

00:02:18.301 --> 00:02:19.970
She's an independent woman,

00:02:20.003 --> 00:02:22.673
and always tries her best
to see the best in people.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:25.542
So when it came to her child's gender,

00:02:25.575 --> 00:02:27.477
she didn't have a lot of expectations

00:02:27.511 --> 00:02:29.746
for what me and Jonas
were supposed to be like.